    "turn_text": "Actually, I've never thought about that. I don't know. I'll have to look into that and get back to you on your next program. There's no one that can say across the board. that the Biden administration has been nothing but a disaster. And when President Trump gets reelected, which I'm really looking forward to, I know that he will be selecting cabinet folks that have learned over these last four years of the Biden administration, plus his four years when he was in office, which no one can no one can argue that his policies were not awesome. You simply cannot. And we're going to get that experience at four years of experience on the ground of what's good. And then these last four years of experience under Joe Biden, what is bad. And I'm very confident that the next Trump administration is going to get us back to a place where we need to be, where we have a safe, prosperous, the America and that these global tensions are cooled because President Trump will be projecting strength and we have peace through strength. It's proven to work.",
